\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Short Scripts\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Seeking feedback:
\f1\b0  "I want to get better at [X]. Can you tell me one thing I could have done differently this week \'97 even something small?"\

\f0\b Pausing before a reactive decision:
\f1\b0  "Let me sit with this for a bit before I respond \'97 I want to make sure I've thought it through."\

\f0\b Giving credit:
\f1\b0  "This worked because [name] did [specific thing]. I want to make sure that's visible."\

\f0\b Repairing harm:
\f1\b0  "I think my decision/comment landed harder than I intended. I'd like to understand the impact and adjust."\

\f0\b Responding ethically to conflict:
\f1\b0  "I want to understand both sides before we decide anything. Can we lay out the facts together first?"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

